#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Fail-closed Docker/OCI boundary for an ARC-AGI-3 contiguous attempt.

This module is deliberately a container *backend*, not a campaign scheduler.
It never imports a caller's Boolean isolation claims.  Instead it creates an
unstarted container, inspects the image and effective container configuration,
and derives a machine-readable launch attestation from those observations.
The container is started only after the same evidence is observed again.

The host supervisor remains responsible for constructing the minimal parent
bundle, validating exports, capturing transcripts, replaying candidates, and
promoting artifacts.  A successful attestation here proves the configured
Docker boundary, not those higher-level properties.
"""

